{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1029_p", "source_sha256": "92ea6ec7657f8697f70fee04f3d1c25e7078906f67b5be7cb6cccc88df539331", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、営業と……ああ、そろそろ\n次の定期公演のセンターを決めないといけないな）", "zh": "（今天的工作是跑业务和……啊对了，\n差不多该决定下次定期公演的Center了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "47a47589d28d8f485064af1d5e8a7f152f87beb162bc64c87a8bdaa5016d6c0c", "ja": "けど、ヒメがラーメンを好きっていうのは、\nちょっと意外だな。", "zh": "不过，没想到公主会喜欢吃拉面，\n令人有点讶异呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "8bce8aa26f80e4ceee90b3c9f4470e5d079ea113e959bfe8d2f5fca59bd6e21f", "ja": "そうでしょうか……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "db8ab6388438ba77471308327dc7a356da41c09ad05494cbc4aa060c266bb426", "ja": "はい。四条さんのイメージといえば、ミステリアス。\nけど、ラーメンは……親しみやすい。", "zh": "是的，因为四条姊给人的印象就是「神秘」。\n但是拉面……反而给人很亲切的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "9f0eada2242e890581d5f80ef005618560a48579082a339234b5b2ddcaa9af23", "ja": "良いことではないでしょうか。\nアイドルは、親しみがあってこそです。", "zh": "这样岂非良事一桩？\n作为偶像自然得亲近大众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b39f324105d12dab89a0882321a4e98fb1d8c635f063f3e27775e7859cef6a3", "ja": "なるほど。アイドルは、親しみがあってこそ。\nたしかに、そのとおりです。", "zh": "原来如此，作为偶像自然得亲近大众。\n的确，一点都没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1005_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1006_p", "source_sha256": "00e2a43bc509ab171f5fda1a0a1b7c8324b24330f4cbc7b6f404434c9bdec2fb", "ja": "お、貴音。それに、瑞希とジュリアか。", "zh": "喔，是贵音，还有瑞希和茱莉亚也在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e372b5bf38287888ad8ea6e468617ecb5e0b83f7f4df1094a57e9f40fc308cfb", "ja": "ちょうどいい。\nみんなに、ちょっと相談したいことがあったんだ。", "zh": "这样正好。\n我有点事情想找你们商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "8c1182622d6e2036c45845eb568aa1b9a53aab9e5e23c3f0ac185a2b51c5771b", "ja": "……それはもしや、次の公演についてでしょうか、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "……你要说的莫非是下一次公演？\n{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1009_p", "source_sha256": "304930232b570e889d66d588f5dc561f3df0c783428e070f86bca2378f374a7e", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうなんだが……。\nどうして俺の考えていることがわかったんだ？", "zh": "是、是啊，就是下次的公演……\n你为什么知道我要说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "c620470fe7267e6bc1a3157211647c0b1b970e210e3642a052519b9c58c2ac6b", "ja": "ふふっ。{$P$}の顔に、\nそう書いてありましたので。", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}，\n因为都写在你的脸上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1b617be89fedb9d312feda8105372ccbb9320aca8f7ccbc98de8dc609de50b1", "ja": "なんと、{$P$}の顔に。\n……私には、まだ見えてこないのですが。じーっ。", "zh": "什么？竟然写在{$P$}脸上？\n……可是我还是看不到呢。（盯）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "fe6d003a6244fc60815430061b0d3e157406b44889e5e487a4fbf8a4421189b1", "ja": "いや、ミズキ。\n今のは、モノの例えでだな……。", "zh": "不对啦，瑞希。\n刚刚那只是一种比喻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9a9d465b1703d71b6a5a6de915b03d4da6521ccae56c244387f89100ab48d53a", "ja": "俺の顔はともかく……。\n貴音の言ったとおり、次の公演の話なんだけど。", "zh": "先别管我的脸了……\n贵音说中了，我要找你们商量下次公演的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2c0c6ebfec41493bdb6bc0d8675e18c2a68f679a9bccd9b919aa266289540003", "ja": "次の公演、瑞希とジュリアのどちらかに\nセンターをやってもらおうって思ってるんだ。", "zh": "下次的公演，我想请瑞希或茱莉亚，\n你们其中一个人担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c1a9e6d8617bf1e806391675878b128178bf9cbc1f1fb1d0b97edd886086aa2", "ja": "何だって！？\nあたしかミズキに、センターを？", "zh": "什么！？\n我或瑞希要担任Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1017_p", "source_sha256": "213e2b373d405c8efc45537f8f3b832b19546e5e9f3911752cc06fae576c01fc", "ja": "ああ。2人とも、センターに立つ力は十分ある。\nただ今回はどちらがいいか、まだ決まらなくて……。", "zh": "没错，你们俩都有足够实力胜任Center。\n只是我难以决定这次要让谁出马……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "bafbafbc5d8dedf745245cc4dc2a9e95b1e93e04e96131e0e7e28ae4138aa115", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました。つまりジュリアさんと私で、\nセンターを賭けた勝負をする、ということですね。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了。也就是说，\n茱莉亚和我将赌上Center的宝座一决胜负，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1020_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "56d7ba011584259ea0ae51b9cee5b9945a3f728e7be49c717026af95a59bcac8", "ja": "なんと……。{$P$}。\n私にもその勝負、見学させていただけませんか。", "zh": "竟然……{$P$}，\n可以请你让我观摩这场对决吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7cf51937976834548ea0f5765dc267a75ac8541dcb17cfcf828478d332e6e0b5", "ja": "いや、瑞希。\n貴音も、そういうことじゃなくて。", "zh": "等等，瑞希。\n还有贵音也是，你们都误会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "a96954cee44a2cda990cfa9720a2f9d6350acba55f1181becf612d9560aff16c", "ja": "私はセンターとして、みんなの前でライブが\nしたいです。ジュリアさんも、そうなのでは？", "zh": "我想要担任Center，在大家面前表演。\n茱莉亚，你应该也一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "82d8e2892693ca638cdfb5cf79f4f39c86319e2ae31150edcf1dcaf15d8a7bcc", "ja": "ミズキ……。", "zh": "瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc6fbcce25e4bcb6066ebfc95ce71cbf3e6a4c827c0f9025e5cbd3ddb7460daa", "ja": "ならば正々堂々、勝負で決めるしかありません。\n……どこからでも、かかってこい。", "zh": "那么就只能堂堂正正地一决胜负了。\n……尽管放马过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "f377be7ac0ceeabd43df00e0946faa244b13d23f2c4d68b723557b1f6951265a", "ja": "その目……本気なんだな、ミズキ。\nいいぜ、それなら受けて立ってやる！", "zh": "你的眼神……看来你是认真的啊，瑞希。\n很好，那我就接下战帖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "3dbbd03b6a2010ec07398ddf2beca93b3d028fb98b9c5bce53975fbed9ed8b85", "ja": "その意気です、ジュリアさん。\n気合い十分……ゴゴゴゴゴ。", "zh": "这样就对了，茱莉亚。\n我的斗志十足……（轰隆隆隆隆）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_025_1028_p", "source_sha256": "22c5ce63dca450b70353fb0ee76d188cac5b5afc7a56fbe8b111d1d7c3648ea0", "ja": "（何だかとんでもない展開になってしまったが……。\nプロデューサーとして、この勝負を見届けよう！）", "zh": "（事情的发展出乎意料……\n不过身为制作人，我就来见证这场比赛吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
